{"description": "Cooked whole-grain rice (brown/red rice) mound at left-center, reddish-brown grains with a matte, moist surface; covers roughly 12% of plate area, about 1.5 cm deep.", "candidates": ["brown rice", "red rice", "wild rice blend"], "grams": 110},
{"description": "Bulgur or cracked wheat pilaf in the lower-center, tan-golden granular texture, dry and matte, fairly flat layer covering about 10% of plate.", "candidates": ["bulgur wheat", "cracked wheat pilaf", "couscous"], "grams": 95},
{"description": "Sliced carrot rounds, bright orange, glossy and slightly tender, some with cooked edges; about 6 pieces in total covering roughly 6% of plate, about 1 cm thick.", "candidates": ["steamed carrot", "roasted carrot", "glazed carrot"], "grams": 60},
{"description": "Sautéed mixed vegetables at upper right: dark green leafy greens (kale or chard), red bell pepper strips, shredded orange carrot, and green beans, with a slight sheen from oil, piled about 2 cm high over roughly 25% of plate.", "candidates": ["sautéed kale and vegetables", "stir-fried mixed vegetables", "braised greens with peppers"], "grams": 150},
{"description": "Pale yellow-green sliced vegetables, some squash or zucchini rounds with cooked, slightly translucent edges, near the vegetable mix, small pieces covering about 4% of plate.", "candidates": ["sautéed zucchini", "yellow squash", "steamed summer squash"], "grams": 45},
{"description": "Small cluster of dark, glossy, wrinkled olives in the lower right, about 8 to 10 olives, moist with slight oil sheen.", "candidates": ["Kalamata olives", "black olives in brine", "oil-cured olives"], "grams": 50},
{"description": "Thin julienned strips of yellow bell pepper and carrot scattered at the lower left, bright, crisp-looking, minimal footprint.", "candidates": ["raw yellow pepper strips", "pickled peppers", "sautéed pepper strips"], "grams": 15},
{"description": "Small cooked potato or root-vegetable piece at upper left, pale yellow-beige, slightly browned edges, roughly 3 cm across.", "candidates": ["boiled potato", "roasted parsnip", "steamed turnip"], "grams": 35}
